        "title": "<h1>Book a Nutrition Review</h1>",
        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "heading_size": 120,
        "text_content": "Our dog nutrition review service provides guidance on your pet's dietary needs to ensure they live a long, healthy life. We assess your dog's current diet, taking into account breed, age, weight and activity level. Based on this review, we offer personalized recommendations on choosing proper commercial diets, creating more balanced meals, supplements, and feeding schedules. Our goal is to help optimize your dog's nutrition for overall physical and behavioral wellness.",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "button_text": "Get started",
        "button_link": "https://calendly.com/nicole-laylopets/nutrition-consult",
