          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Certified Holistic Canine Behavior Consultant (CHBC) - Canine Principles ",
            "text": "<p>A course dedicated to understanding the impacts of mental, physical and emotional wellness on canine behavior. Strong focus on creating and maintaining physical wellness through proper canine nutrition along with how it affects overall canine health, well-being and behaviour.</p>",
