        "testimonial_m6qmDF": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>I was skeptical doing virtual training, but it actually worked. I have 4 german shepherds. Emily and I worked on my most difficult one.She's a little over a year head strong and so much energy.Emily came thru with different training techniques. When she suggested one I didn't think would work she had another back up plan right away. My girl keeps progressing everyday. All training techniques Emily gave I can use on my other 3. Emily did a great job teaching me to. Can't thank her enough.Also, want to give a thank you to Nicole, I met her for a 15 session for a particular quirk my girl had every morning. Her recommendations has worked wonders. Can't thank them both enough. I even think some of my sanity is coming back.😁</p>",
            "customer_name": "Stephanie Strang",
            "subheading": "<p>Verified Review </p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_VYJz9C": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>My fiancé and I were blessed with our rescue dog earlier this year, after finding him under our car in the intense summer heat, alone and malnourished. This traumatic experience left him scared of people and other dogs. We began to feel isolated and overwhelmed due to his intense reactivity, and we really felt hopeless until we found LAY LO pets. With a team of professionals, we were met with compassion and reassurance that we could help our dog. This training has not only helped our dog immensely, but also us as dog owners, giving us the tools to build a solid foundation for the rest of his life. Online dog training may seem intimidating at first, but LAY LO is truly equipped with quality trainers, and are with you every step of the way. Our questions were always answered with detailed responses and we felt like our dog's interests were always put first. We love LAY LO, and so will you.</p>",
            "customer_name": "Madi Davis",
            "subheading": "<p>Verified Review </p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_pjNBLh": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>What an amazing experience! Our trainer Emily was incredible! Her attention to detail was second to none. At first I didn't know what to expect training 2 dogs virtually, but Emily made things fun and easy to follow.I am especially thankful for the games she taught us to help with leash reactivity.The communication with the entire team was smooth and easy during the 6 weeks we spent training. The resources that were given to us during graduation have been so valuable and we continue to see improvements each week. Thank you so much to Emily and the whole team, you are game changers!</p>",
            "customer_name": "Josh Moran",
            "subheading": "<p>Verified Review </p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_bRYLt8": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>Lay Lo's convenience of training via zoom is what made me choose them. Besides it made sense that us pet owners should be the ones interacting with our dog directly during training. Their positive reinforcement philosophy is what I loved the first when our sessions started. Emily is not only extremely knowledgeable and professional but thorough in every concept and explanation about Mia's behavior. I highly recommend Lay Lo and Emily of course. Mia's issues have improved and continue progressing because now I have the tools to keep reinforcing her towards being a well behaved little mauxie.</p>",
            "customer_name": "Mia",
            "subheading": "<p>Verified Review </p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Azy7wQ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>I highly recommend Lay Lo. Our experience has been the best. Emily is a true professional, extremely knowledgeable and super thorough with all the concepts regarding Mia's behavioral issues. Training via zoom was convenient and efficient. Mia's behavior has been improving even after our sessions were completed. I now have the tools to address each situation with enrichment activities, games, and most importantly I now have a robust understanding of how a dog perceives the world.</p>",
            "customer_name": "Natalia",
            "subheading": "<p>Verified Review</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LWhkWX": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>Emily is my miracle! I’ve worked with other trainers before, and she is by far the best one I’ve ever dealt with. She was so easy to talk to, understanding, and always available when I needed her. She helped me through some really tough times with Lady and Bandit. I felt like she cared for us like family. I couldn’t be more grateful that I found this training program and Emily!</p>",
            "customer_name": "Lady and Bandit",
            "subheading": "<p>Verified Review</p>"
          }
        }
      },
