            "text": "<p><strong>Meet your trainer weekly for as many weeks as you like. Cancel Anytime.</strong></p><p></p><p>Intensive Pup Evaluation</p><p>Weekly Live 1:1 Session / week (45-min)</p><p>2x Weekly Practice Sessions (15-min)</p><p>Message-an-Expert</p><p>Dedicated Trainer</p><p>LAY LO™ Product Discounts</p><p></p><p>* * * </p><p>Course Membership Library - Limited Access</p><p></p>",
