    "section_accordions_4nkBhU": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Gtjxxf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why do you train online?",
            "text": "<p>Science has proven that the best environment for your pet to learn is without distractions. Training outside of the home brings not only new smells but new people and other animals to get excited about which breaks your pet's focus and slows down the behavior modification process. That’s why we only offer virtual training at home so you and your pup can make progress together ASAP. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Uy4awU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much time do you spend with my dog?",
            "text": "<p>With Homeschool, YOU become the expert in training your dog throughout the program and beyond. It takes 1,000 repetitions to shape a dog’s behavior – which is why outside of our 45-min, 1:1 video sessions we check-in daily via text and are available for any questions so you can get faster results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_qtXJVJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is virtual training?",
            "text": "<p>Virtual training is quickly becoming the most effective training method to get long-term results. Through weekly 1:1 video calls with your dedicated trainer, we demonstrate the training techniques and watch as you practice in real time with your dog. After each call, we'll provide homework and video lessons to track your progress. Still curious? Watch a sample virtual training lesson <a href=\"https://fub.direct/1/-8r8SWmgQ6mGu0nIMQoO0KB48bJeKRwbhImxJ_eJbkJmAVQstrWW-CwiqVOlv9bO1XaggZc-7wdj10103TwdJQ/https/www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a> &gt;</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_34jcB4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your training philosophy?",
            "text": "<p>We are proud to stand behind positive-reinforcement training practices, the most powerful tool recognized by PETA, the ASPCA, and the Humane  Society of America to transform your pet's behavior. All of our trainers are force-free certified experts ensuring that the techniques you learn are promoting a positive and healthy relationship between you and your pet. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_hH3nHc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does virtual training work?",
            "text": "<p>We’ve worked with pet parents across the country to transform their pet's behavior from complex reactivity issues to puppy training, the <a href=\"https://fub.direct/1/eeU_0HM1yBmykb6BMUt4kvI5Y9JJqzvM70XERtK0ytjfA98XIpYTk1yu-xKRc9B1yW29Km2EIGnDZ_ZfOpcq7w/https/www.bark.com/settings/profile/my_profile/?&ps=reviews\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.bark.com/settings/profile/my_profile/?&ps=reviews\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">dozens of video reviews</span></a> we have speak for themselves.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
